    "title": "Dhoba: washing, payment and ceremonial work",
    "kind": "Reading",
    "area": "Odisha",
    "summary": "Washing clothes could involve more than a payment for clean garments. Accounts from Odisha describe work tied to the harvest, family ceremonies and worship at the washing place. They also reveal unequal relationships within village life.",
    "href": "/communities/dhoba/",
    "checked": "2026-10-23",
    "practical": [
      {
        "heading": "Payment after the harvest",
