        "heading": "Old Town / Ekamra heritage area",
        "text": "Begin here if temple architecture is the centre of your visit. Put Mukteswar and your other chosen stops on the map before comparing rooms. Trace the route from the property entrance, including any stretch you would walk. Ask where a vehicle can collect you after a visit. For an early start, ask when breakfast is served and whether luggage can be left before check-in. A heritage-area address alone does not establish walking access."
