        "heading": "Janpath and the central city",
        "text": "Compare this area if your plans mix shopping, meals and heritage visits. Judge the address against the whole day, including the return to your room. Plan each old-town trip separately. A central address does not make every stop walkable, and a short line on a map is not a door-to-door journey. Ask which entrance the driver should use and whether the room faces a busy road. If a quiet night matters, request a specific room position rather than relying on the property’s description."
