      {
        "heading": "An arrival-focused base",
        "text": "If you arrive late or leave early, start with your actual airport or railway-station transfer. The useful room is one you can reach and use at the hours you need. Confirm the pickup meeting point, transfer charge and departure estimate with the property or driver. “Near the airport” is not a verified travel time. Give your arrival date as well as the hour, especially after midnight. Ask when the booked room becomes available and whether early check-in or late checkout costs extra."
