        "text": "Kala Bhoomi, the Odisha Crafts Museum, connects visitors with Odisha’s crafts and the people and skills behind them. You do not need to know the names before you arrive. Choose one object that makes you pause. Read its material, place and maker information where the label supplies them. Then ask: what had to be understood before this could be made?"
