      },
      {
        "heading": "Take a question beyond the museum",
        "text": "A museum can sharpen the next conversation you have with a maker. Pipili offers a way to keep looking at cloth, while Dhauli asks what words carved in stone were meant to do. Choose the next stop around your available time and transport; these connections are not a timed route. Keep a meal break in Bhubaneswar and explore dishes such as Dalma through our city food guide. Save the museum now and shape the rest of the day later."
