        "heading": "A boat is also a collection of skills",
        "text": "This 2013 photograph shows a museum display: a wooden hull and figures arranged around the work of building it. It invites a closer look at a boat’s shape, joints and parts. It is not a photograph of workers building a vessel. For a playful pause, choose one part and explain what you think it does. Then read the display label or ask a guide. What changed in your answer? The people behind the workshop deserve the same curiosity. How did someone learn the trade? What did an ordinary working day involve? Those workers’ histories remain a research gap in our account."
