    "kind": "Reading",
    "area": "Odisha",
    "summary": "How does a community history emerge from the objects people make? Sunari accounts in Odisha lead into workshops, households and markets. They also raise a necessary question: when several communities practise the same craft, what can the craft itself tell us about identity?",
