        "text": "OTDC’s separate Panthanivas Rambha listing gives an address in Rambha, Ganjam. Its description places the stay beside Chilika with views towards the Ghantasila hills and names Breakfast Island, Honeymoon Island and Birds Island as nearby excursion ideas. These are published leads, not a confirmed itinerary. If those island names are what draw you to Rambha, ask the boat operator to explain the proposed route. Which places will you pass, where can you actually land, and how long would the outing take? Do not read a destination description as a promise to stop at every island it mentions. Barkul and Rambha are separate bases. Compare each proposed stay with its own departure point and the rest of your journey; a booking labelled simply “Chilika” leaves too much unresolved."
